# registry name in Windows | file in this folder
# The launcher needs these: app.xaml asks for the families "Segoe UI, Yu Gothic UI, Microsoft YaHei UI" and
# "Cascadia Mono, Consolas". Free fonts were renamed (nameID 1/16) with rename_font.py.
Segoe UI (TrueType)|SegoeUI.ttf
Segoe UI Bold (TrueType)|SegoeUI-Bold.ttf
Segoe UI Italic (TrueType)|SegoeUI-Italic.ttf
Segoe UI Bold Italic (TrueType)|SegoeUI-BoldItalic.ttf
Consolas (TrueType)|Consolas.ttf
Consolas Bold (TrueType)|Consolas-Bold.ttf
Cascadia Mono (TrueType)|CascadiaMono.ttf
